2026-10-02T14:14:13.2523428Z # One --red flag per name, never one comma-joined value: a check
2026-10-02T14:14:13.2523791Z # name containing a comma would split into fragments neither the
2026-10-02T14:14:13.2524094Z # refusal nor `## Red checks` can match.
2026-10-02T14:14:13.2524327Z RED_ARGS=()
